{"type": "spr", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"left parenthesis x minus 47 right parenthesis squared equals 1\"><mrow>\n\t<msup>\n\t\t<mfenced>\n\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>47</mn>\n\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t</mfenced>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t</msup>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the sum of the solutions to the given equation?</p>", "keys": ["94"], "rationale": "<p>The correct answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"94\"><mn>94</mn></math>. Taking the square root of each side of the given equation yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 47 equals 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 47 equals negative 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. Adding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"47\"><mn>47</mn></math> to both sides of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 47 equals 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals 48\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math>. Adding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"47\"><mn>47</mn></math> to both sides of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x minus 47 equals negative 1\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals 46\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>46</mn></math>. Therefore, the sum of the solutions to the given equation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"48 plus 46\"><mn>48</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"94\"><mn>94</mn></math>.</p>", "externalid": "8204e6e4-4fd9-46f0-8199-646409cd8719", "correct_answer": ["94"]}